{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53528","headline":"赞碎金 · 王建","name":"赞碎金","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一轴零书则（斯六一九卷作「时」）未多，要来不得（斯六一九卷作「问」）那人何？\n从头至尾无闲字，胜看真（斯六一九卷作「珍」）珠一百螺。\n（见斯六二○四卷《字宝碎金》末附，署「吏部郎中王建」。\n斯六一九卷署「王建郎中」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}